web/dist/

# setup-emsdk caches the SDK inside the workspace. Left untracked it makes the
# tree look dirty, and the web build then refuses to stamp the commit into the
# page's source link, because a dirty tree is not a commit anyone can be
# pointed at.
emsdk-*/
